---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { liveApps } from '../data/apps';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Randy Torres"
	pubDate={new Date('Jan 05 2026')}
>
	<h2>Hi, I'm Randy</h2>

	<p>
		I'm a principal engineer, AI architect, app builder, and real estate investor based in McAllen,
		Texas. I’m married with four kids, and this site is where I document the attempt to build more
		freedom without missing the family life happening along the way.
	</p>

	<h3>What I'm working on</h3>

	<ul>
		<li><strong>Apps:</strong> {liveApps.length} apps live on the App Store — utilities, games, and tools. See them all on <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/randy-torres/id1871953838" target="_blank" rel="noopener">my developer page</a> or the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/#apps`}>apps section</a> of the homepage.</li>
		<li><strong>Real estate:</strong> Managing rental properties in South Texas</li>
		<li><strong>Learning:</strong> AI, automation, and whatever keeps me growing</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Code</h3>

	<p>
		Most of my open work lives on <a href="https://github.com/RandyVentures" target="_blank">GitHub</a>.
	</p>

	<h3>Connect</h3>

	<p>
		Find me on <a href="https://github.com/RandyVentures" target="_blank">GitHub</a> or reach out via
		email: rltorres26@gmail.com
	</p>

	<hr />

	<p class="italic text-sm">
		This blog is maintained with help from Will, my AI assistant. All posts are written/edited by
		me, with AI helping format and publish.
	</p>
</Layout>